text: ['As Adaptive Automaton enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nAdaptive Automaton is the chosen type in addition to its other types.\\nOther creatures you control of the chosen type get +1/+1.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a creature card from your hand.\\nDisaster Radius deals X damage to each creature your opponents control, where X is the revealed card's mana value.", 'Crumbling Necropolis enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nWhen Jungle Barrier enters the battlefield, draw a card.", 'Destroy all creatures.', 'Destroy target creature or enchantment.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', "Double target player's life total. Shuffle Beacon of Immortality into its owner's library.", 'Draw three cards.', 'Each player sacrifices a creature.', 'Enchant creature with mana value 2 or less\\nYou control enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has first strike, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has flying, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has vigilance, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3, has trample, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has indestructible.\\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield, you may attach Shielded by Faith to that creature.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Flying, deathtouch, lifelink', "Flying\\nVampire Interloper can't block.", 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, put that many +1/+1 counters on it.', 'For each opponent, gain control of target permanent that player controls.', 'For each opponent, gain control of up to one target creature that player controls until end of turn. Untap those creatures. They gain haste until end of turn.', 'Jungle Shrine enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}, {G}, or {W}.', 'Lifelink', 'Lightning Helix deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', "Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{T}: Target Merfolk creature can't be blocked this turn.", "Return six target nonland permanents to their owners' hands.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Untap that creature.', 'Target creature gets +1/+2 and gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn. You may tap any number of untapped Vampire creatures you control. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on each of those Vampires.', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Target player takes an extra turn after this one.', 'Trample\\nWhenever another nontoken creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control get +1/+1 and creatures your opponents control get -1/-1.', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +3/+3 and gains trample and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw that many cards."', 'When Borderland Ranger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Whenever a creature you control attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking creature that shares a creature type with it.', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodbond Vampire.', '{3}{R}{R}: Untap all creatures you control. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{4}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.']
flavor: ['"Assume everything wants to kill you. At the very least, assume everything wants what\'s in your pack."', '"Every Silumgar blade carries the blessing of our dragonlord."\\n—Xathi the Infallible', '"I prefer loyalty to be a matter of respect, not of magic. But one does what one must."\\n—Kaalia of the Vast', '"It is the nature of souls that they burn more brightly together than apart."\\n—Vessifrus, flamekin demagogue', '"Jarad fancies himself king of the undercity, but he\'s merely king of rot."', '"Let the vampires join us. In this war, we no longer have the luxury of choosing our comrades."\\n—General Tazri, allied commander', '"No emergency is so dire that it cannot be dealt with elegantly."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"Over time, Konda grew ever more suspicious, fearing even his most loyal allies were being manipulated by unseen hands."\\n—*The History of Kamigawa*', '"Rejoice! Your vile blood will help fulfill our righteous cause."', '"Ruhan would never agree to such terms."\\n—Ruhan of the Fomori', '"Savagery is the birthright of every creature that draws breath—or wishes it could."\\n—Karador, Ghost Chieftain', '"Soaring is wasted on the winged."\\n—Edric, Spymaster of Trest', '"The treasure in my mind is greater than any worldly glory."', '"There\'s only one route from Kessig into Stensia. Unless you come with me."', '"We are not an empire, and I am not a queen. But I speak with the shout of the rivers and the whisper of the clinging mist."', '"You too, Squib?"', 'Centuries of association with the Sun Empire have taught the dinosaurs that shiny things are important.', 'He listens to every heartbeat, deciding which one of hundreds he will stop.', "It bends not light but mana, aligning its chaotic currents into the sharp angles necessary for the mystic's purposes.", "It's said the spirits of the drowned dead hang their lights from the shattered figureheads.", "It's there when a seed sprouts, when gourds ripen on the vines, and when the reapers cut the grains under the Harvest Moon.", "Just when you thought you'd survived the first wave.", "Many who cross Sorin's path come down with a sudden and fatal case of being-in-the-way-of-a-millennia-old-vampire.", 'Nature exists in balance: river and jungle, sky and sea, predator and prey.', 'Not to be. That is the answer.', 'Scarecrows only go so far in sending the message to stay away.', 'Sins that would be too gruesome in the light of day are made more pleasing in the dark of night.', 'The cave floods with light. A thousand rays shine forth and meld into one.', 'The militia formed up in the central plaza awaiting the onslaught, but the giants never quite made it.', 'The people of the Sun Empire worship the sun in three aspects: the creative sun, the sustaining sun, and the destructive sun.', 'The void is without substance but cuts like steel.', 'Those who examine the amulet too closely have been known to become part of its ornate carvings.', "Though less well-known than its army of soldiers, the Boros Legion's mage-priests are as respected by the innocent as they are hated by the ghosts of the guilty.", "To be counted among the warriors of Setessa's Leina Tower, you must not fear death, only failure.", 'Within silent clearings guarded by living palisades, the natural world guards its most precious secrets.', 'Zombies mourn for the living and celebrate those who will soon be given the gift of death.']
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Ash Wood', 'Brad Rigney', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Don Hazeltine', 'Erica Yang', 'Eytan Zana', 'Greg Staples', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason Chan', 'Jim Pavelec', 'Johann Bodin', 'Jon Foster', 'Kev Walker', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Nils Hamm', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Chou', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Winona Nelson', 'Zoltan Boros', 'rk post']
